## Overview

A lovely outing for tobogganing if you’re already in Flims.
The ascent takes about 1 hour and offers stunning winter scenery.

## How to get there

The route starts directly in Brün. It is possible to travel there by bus (line 404), but travelling directly by car is recommended.
It is advisable to arrive in Brün at around 11 am, as the area near Piz Riein can quickly become shaded outside lunchtime.
